Package: zoomriya-model
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: systemd, libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: The box's one language model, for Myira and the ZOOMRIYA apps
 Keeps one model in memory (Gemma 4, from /data/models/llms) in llama.cpp's
 llama-server and answers on loopback only (127.0.0.1:8070): Box Desktop's
 Myira and, when installed, every ZOOMRIYA app that asks, one answer at a
 time. It checks each asker's ZOOMRIYA ID token, lets an admin choose the
 model, and keeps nothing it is asked. It can't reach the internet.
